<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAR 27.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAR 27.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Thursday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Mar 27	Mar 26     Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  265.850     266.350     247.020    7.62 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  307.450     306.520     306.830    0.20 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  158.210     157.785     158.970   -0.48 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.938	46.800	47.182   -0.52 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  433.000     432.000     419.180    3.30 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.680     140.260     141.685   -0.71 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.841	15.771	16.185   -2.13 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  215.130     214.700     212.430    1.27 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.866	 1.858	 1.888   -1.17 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.574	 1.568	 1.581   -0.44 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  182.795     181.760     183.135   -0.19%</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
